meta {
  name: Invoices
}

docs {
  ## Dossier Invoices

  Facturation : factures, génération depuis une consultation, lignes, statuts, indicateurs financiers et PDF.

  ### Requêtes

  - `PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}/status` — Change Status
  - `POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices` — Create
  - `DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}` — Delete
  - `POST {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/from-consultation/{{consultationId}}` — From Consultation
  - `GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}` — Get
  - `GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices?page=1&limit=20` — List
  - `GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/me` — Me
  - `GET {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/stats` — Stats
  - `PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{invoiceId}}` — Update

  Toutes les requêtes utilisent l’environnement **Local** et l’en-tête `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}` sauf mention contraire.
}
